{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56316","headline":"鸡笼山 · 李思聪","name":"鸡笼山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山状鸡笼攒翠黛，水通滴沥落水崖。\n谁知内隐神仙宅，金叠云房玉琢阶。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷四八《和州》。\n同卷《碑目》云：「唐李思聪《鸡笼山》诗，在和州小厅东。\n」清赵绍祖《安徽金石略》卷九亦着录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李思聪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56316.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56316","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}